Defaced structural MRIs administered for clinical evaluation of safety for the study: Focused Ultrasound for the Complex Patient (LIFU) [https://clinicaltrials.gov/study/NCT06453109?locStr=Washington%20D.C.,%20DC&country=US&state=District%20of%20Columbia&city=Washington&intr=focused%20ultrasound&rank=2, https://reporter.nih.gov/search/SiQpbWQD_E6F7W3kfIJMPw/project-details/10775216]. Made publicly available as part of the NIH HEAL Initiative.